        { "text", text = "At 50, |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Darnath Bladesinger|r, the warrior trainer of Darnassus, sends you to the |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Fallen Hero of the Horde|r in the Swamp of Sorrows." },
